                {
                    "markdown": "- Taps are no longer swallowed while a touch indicator is fading out, fast typing on the keyboard works as usual\n- New **Morph** effect: the touch flows behind your finger like a liquid drop, respects the corner radius and rounds into a bubble when pulled\n- New **Comet** effect: a fading trail behind your finger, like a shooting star\n- Idle breathing: a resting touch gently grows and shrinks\n- Custom image instead of the touch, picked from Photos and resized to fit 180×180 px with its proportions kept\n- Smoother tracking on fast swipes and ProMotion displays\n- New Effects and Image sections in settings\n- The app version is now shown in settings automatically\n- Fixed the Ko-fi caption in Russian\n- Support links moved to Boosty and Buy me a coffee",
